      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": ":pep:`680`, Support for parsing TOML in the standard library",
      "source_hash": 1463030522558561369,
      "context_hash": 15762651884830287020,
      "translation": ":pep:`680`, 표준 라이브러리에서 TOML 구문 분석 지원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:48.702433Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 3.11 is up to 10-60% faster than Python 3.10.",
      "source_hash": 15527081973352689080,
      "context_hash": 17596852344171089974,
      "translation": "Python 3.11은 Python 3.10보다 최대 10~60% 빠릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:48.702435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "On average, we measured a 1.25x speedup on the standard benchmark suite.",
      "source_hash": 5886487843673576202,
      "context_hash": 6860436467493996447,
      "translation": "평균적으로 표준 벤치마크 모음에서 1.25배의 속도 향상을 측정했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:48.702436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "See `Faster CPython <https://docs.python.org/3.11/whatsnew/3.11.html#faster-cpython>`__ for details.",
      "source_hash": 15686366507304870075,
      "context_hash": 10843954139028915477,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 `Faster CPython <https://docs.python.org/3.11/whatsnew/3.11.html#faster-cpython>`__\\ 을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:28:48.702436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
